        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>The sales effect of \"Free App of the Day\" on Amazon Appstore: An empirical study</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\", \"Segoe UI\", Verdana, sans-serif;\n    color: #14203a;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .poster {\n    width: 1100px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Header ---------- */\n  header {\n    background: #d92b21;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    padding: 75px 78px 60px 78px;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  header .bg-note {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;\n    background: linear-gradient(105deg, #cf2a20 0%, #d8352b 45%, #c9251c 100%);\n    opacity: 1;\n    z-index: 0;\n  }\n  header .head-inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n  header h1 {\n    font-size: 40px;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    max-width: 780px;\n  }\n  header .authors {\n    font-size: 27px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: #1b1b1b;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .header-photo-note {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 20px;\n    top: 12px;\n    z-index: 2;\n    width: 430px;\n    height: 300px;\n    border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.55);\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    padding: 6px 8px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Section headings ---------- */\n  h2.section {\n    color: #e8503f;\n    font-size: 25px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n    margin: 0 0 20px 0;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Upper band ---------- */\n  .band {\n    background: #f1f1f1;\n    padding: 55px 78px 60px 78px;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 20px;\n  }\n  .band .left { flex: 1 1 auto; max-width: 730px; }\n  .band .right { flex: 0 0 300px; position: relative; }\n  .band p { margin: 0; }\n  .band .objective { margin-top: 52px; }\n\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #b3b3b3;\n    color: #7a7a7a;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-style: italic;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);\n  }\n  .phone-ph {\n    width: 290px;\n    height: 400px;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Two column body ---------- */\n  .cols {\n    display: flex;\n    padding: 45px 78px 0 78px;\n    gap: 0;\n  }\n  .col-left {\n    flex: 0 0 48%;\n    padding-right: 45px;\n  }\n  .col-right {\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n    padding-left: 55px;\n    border-left: 1px solid #cfcfcf;\n  }\n  .col-left ol.method {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  .col-left ol.method > li {\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  .col-left ol.method .sub {\n    font-weight: 400;\n    margin: 0 0 0 30px;\n    text-indent: 0;\n  }\n  .col-left ol.method .sub.wrap {\n    margin-left: 0;\n    text-indent: 30px;\n  }\n  .col-right p { margin: 0; }\n\n  /* ---------- Table ---------- */\n  table.results {\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    width: 100%;\n    margin-top: 40px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  table.results thead th {\n    background: #e8483c;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    padding: 14px 10px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  table.results tbody td {\n    padding: 8px 10px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  table.results tbody td.rowlab {\n    background: #35aec2;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: 500;\n  }\n  table.results tbody tr:nth-child(odd) td.val { background: #f0f0f0; }\n  table.results tbody tr:nth-child(even) td.val { background: #ffffff; }\n\n  .table-foot {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-top: 14px;\n  }\n  .table-foot .r2 {\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  .table-foot .sig {\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    text-align: right;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Conclusion ---------- */\n  .conclusion {\n    padding: 30px 78px 55px 78px;\n  }\n  .conclusion h2.section { margin-bottom: 16px; }\n  .conclusion p { margin: 0; font-size: 17px; }\n\n  /* ---------- Footer ---------- */\n  footer {\n    background: #000000;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    padding: 45px 78px 55px 78px;\n    font-size: 16.5px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n  }\n  footer b { font-weight: 700; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"poster\">\n\n  <header>\n    <div class=\"bg-note\"></div>\n    <div class=\"header-photo-note placeholder\">[Photo: background, top-right — hands holding a mobile device]</div>\n    <div class=\"head-inner\">\n      <h1>The sales effect of &ldquo;Free App of the Day&rdquo;<br>on Amazon Appstore: An empirical study</h1>\n      <p class=\"authors\">Hong Chen, Kevin Lachaud, Wenqi Zhou</p>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"band\">\n    <div class=\"left\">\n      <h2 class=\"section\">INTRODUCTION</h2>\n      <p>Apps, as an abbreviation of mobile applications, are software products for mobile platforms (Tang, 2016). They are designed to perform certain tasks on mobile devices (Islam, Islam, &amp; Mazumder, 2010). This product category has grown to become a gigantic differentiated market with over 3.48 million apps on Google Play, an app marketplace, and the recent projection of over 935-billion-dollar revenue in 2023 (Statista Research, 2021a, Statista Research, 2021b).</p>\n\n      <div class=\"objective\">\n        <h2 class=\"section\">OBJECTIVE</h2>\n        <p>This work studies the adverse effect of &ldquo;Free App of the Day&rdquo; at Amazon Appstore.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"right\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder phone-ph\">[Illustration: right side — 3D hand tapping a smartphone screen, wearing a red smartwatch reading 20:12]</div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"cols\">\n    <div class=\"col-left\">\n      <h2 class=\"section\">METHODOLOGY</h2>\n      <ol class=\"method\">\n        <li>1. Literature review</li>\n        <div class=\"sub\">a. Digital free sampling</div>\n        <div class=\"sub\">b. eWOM</div>\n        <li>2. Hypotheses</li>\n        <div class=\"sub wrap\">a. H1 - Online user decisions to adopt apps are discouraged by the price rebound after the zero-price offering of FAD ends. The sharper price rebound leads to a greater decrease in app adoptions.</div>\n        <div class=\"sub wrap\">b. H2 - Conditional on the total volume of eWOM, organic reviews are more influential to online user decisions of adopting apps than promotion-induced reviews after the FAD promotion ends.</div>\n        <li>3. Data</li>\n        <div class=\"sub\">a. Context and data collection</div>\n        <div class=\"sub\">b. Key variables</div>\n        <li>4. Empirical analysis</li>\n        <div class=\"sub\">a. Exploratory analysis</div>\n        <div class=\"sub\">b. Regression model and results</div>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"col-right\">\n      <h2 class=\"section\">RESULTS</h2>\n      <p>We notice that a few apps were off the direct spotlight post-promotion; however, they still offer zero price for another one or two days.</p>\n      <p>Specifically, an increase in SkewDailyi indicates a more right skewed distribution of daily number of reviews during the post-promotion period.</p>\n\n      <table class=\"results\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>Empty Cell</th>\n            <th>Mean</th>\n            <th>S.D.</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td class=\"rowlab\">PriceReboundi,t</td><td class=\"val\">&minus;0.40***</td><td class=\"val\">0.06</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"rowlab\">SkewDailyi</td><td class=\"val\">&minus;0.19*</td><td class=\"val\">0.11</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"rowlab\">KurtDdailyi</td><td class=\"val\">&minus;0.09**</td><td class=\"val\">0.05</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"rowlab\">Ln(NumReviewsi,t)</td><td class=\"val\">0.59***</td><td class=\"val\">0.08</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"rowlab\">AverageRatingi,t</td><td class=\"val\">2.06***</td><td class=\"val\">0.40</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"rowlab\">VarianceRatingi,t</td><td class=\"val\">1.17***</td><td class=\"val\">0.30</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"rowlab\">Dayi,t</td><td class=\"val\">&minus;0.11*</td><td class=\"val\">0.03</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"rowlab\">Agei,t</td><td class=\"val\">&minus;0.0004***</td><td class=\"val\">0.0002</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"rowlab\">AppSizei,t</td><td class=\"val\">0.01***</td><td class=\"val\">0.002</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n\n      <div class=\"table-foot\">\n        <div class=\"r2\">R2 = 0.45</div>\n        <div class=\"sig\">\n          * $p &lt; 0.1$.<br>\n          **$p &lt; 0.05$.<br>\n          ***$p &lt; 0.01$.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"conclusion\">\n    <h2 class=\"section\">CONCLUSION</h2>\n    <p>We conclude that these promotion-induced reviews are less influential than organic reviews.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer>\n    <b>References:</b> Chen, H., Lachaud, K. and Zhou, W., 2022. The sales effect of &ldquo;Free App of the Day&rdquo; on Amazon Appstore: An empirical study. Digital Business, 2(2), p.100020.\n  </footer>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
